  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed scheme would extend an existing extension to the main house, and would result in a bulky and obtrusive form of development that would no longer remain subservient to the proportions of the original house.  On account of its inappropriate design, the proposed conversion of the existing side garage would introduce a second entrance door on the principal elevation, which would undermine the architectural coherence of the host dwelling, erode the subservient appearance required of side extensions, and create the appearance of a second self-contained residential unit. The proposed design therefore results in harm to character of the main house, the public streetscene and the surrounding area, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 and CC2 and intention the Residential Extension Guidelines (Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD)."
  ],
